<title>VIETNAM: Vietnam CPI down 0.5 percent in mth/mth in May.</title>
<headline>Vietnam CPI down 0.5 percent in mth/mth in May.</headline>
<dateline>HANOI 1997-05-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Vietnamese statistics officials gave the following economic indicator on Saturday: (Percentage change)</p>
<p> VIETNAM CONSUMER PRICE INDEX	May 97	 Apr 97</p>
<p> Month/month			     -0.5	    -0.6</p>
<p> Year/year				  1.6	     1.6</p>
</text>
